OL,14,G0350 Witness History
OL,15,     FIn 1985, a small rural town
OL,16,     Fwelcomed a group of Catholic
OL,17,     Fmissionaries, unaware one would
OL,18,     Fone day be Pope. Among the altar
OL,19,     Fboys was a teenager who would go
OL,20,     Fon to be his friend.
